      "message": "Maybe better: \"review comments\"?\n\nPosting a review usually includes voting on the Code-Review label, but this permission doesn\u0027t allow voting on the Code-Review label. Maybe to avoid confusion say explicitly that this permission doesn\u0027t allow voting on any label?",
